# agent-contract consumer profile schema
#
# Required keys
# - PROFILE_NAME: profile identifier used by apply/check/doctor
# - REPO_DISPLAY_NAME: human-readable repo name for generated AGENTS.md
# - REPO_ROOT: absolute consumer repo root
# - PRIMARY_MODULE_TYPE: short description of the repo/module shape
# - MAIN_SOURCE_ROOTS: newline-delimited paths
# - GENERATED_AGENTS_PATH: relative path to generated AGENTS.md
# - MASTER_PLAN_PATH: relative path to canonical master plan
# - TASK_PATHS: newline-delimited relative task paths
# - PLAN_PATHS: newline-delimited relative plan paths
# - ARCHITECTURE_PATHS: newline-delimited relative architecture doc paths
# - VERIFICATION_COMMANDS: newline-delimited commands rendered into AGENTS.md
# - SCRATCH_SINK: relative sink path, usually .agent-scratch
#
# Optional keys
# - REQUIRED_SKILLS: newline-delimited skill routing requirements rendered into
#   generated AGENTS.md before local constraints
# - FORBIDDEN_PATHS: newline-delimited relative paths that must not exist
# - LOCAL_CONSTRAINTS: newline-delimited repo-specific constraint statements
# - MANAGED_WORKTREE_ROOTS: newline-delimited additional relative roots that
#   should receive scratch-path management even if they are not nested git roots
#
# Delimiter rules
# - Multi-value fields are newline-delimited inside shell quotes.
# - Values should be relative to REPO_ROOT unless explicitly absolute.
# - Workflow policy belongs in the shared contract, not in this profile.
